'''RPG Life Sciences''' ('''RPGLS''') is an Indian pharmaceutical company. Formerly known as Searle (India) Ltd, RPG Life Sciences is part of [[RPG Enterprises]].<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.hindustantimes.com/RPG-Life-Sciences-eyes-private-equity-placement/Article1-436875.aspx |archive-url=https://archive.today/20130125202104/http://www.hindustantimes.com/RPG-Life-Sciences-eyes-private-equity-placement/Article1-436875.aspx |url-status=dead |archive-date=25 January 2013 |title=RPG Life Sciences eyes private equity placement |publisher=Hindustan Times |date=2009-07-27 |accessdate=2010-09-28}}</ref> It has its corporate office in RPG House in [[Worli]], [[Mumbai]]. Its three major activities are the manufacturing and marketing of bulk drugs, also known as [[Active ingredient|active pharmaceutical ingredients]] (API); pharmaceutical formulation; and fermentation and biotechnology. RPGLS is present in the domestic as well as the international market. It exports its products primarily to Europe, Latin America, Australia and South East Asian countries.<ref>[http://www.rpggroup.com/bussectors/rpglifesciences/profile.asp] {{webarchive|url=https://web.archive.org/web/20070630005638/http://www.rpggroup.com/bussectors/rpglifesciences/profile.asp|date=30 June 2007}}</ref>

